948	/// Incremental RFC 6962 Merkle Tree Hash over an LF-separated byte stream.
949	///
950	/// Bytes are fed through [`RootStream::feed`] in chunks of any size; how many
951	/// bytes one read returns is meaningless to the result, and a record that
952	/// spans any number of chunks is hashed in full. Records are delimited by LF
