954	/// trailing LF only terminates the last record, an empty input is zero
955	/// records), and the tree is folded with the same largest-power-of-two split
956	/// as `build_tree`, so [`RootStream::finish`] returns exactly
957	/// `mth(&split_records(whole))` for the concatenation `whole` of everything
958	/// fed.
959	///
960	/// Memory use is a small fixed amount plus at most 64 subtree hashes (one per
